OL,3,GNEWSASadness as one of city's last
OL,4,Adepartment stores to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuxury department store Harvey Nichols
OL,7,Fhas announced it will close its store
OL,8,Fin Birmingham in January.
OL,10,FThe move has been described as "a huge
OL,11,Fblow to the city and shoppers".
OL,13,FThe Mailbox store doubled in size in
OL,14,F2015 and is home to more than 200
OL,15,Fbrands - many exclusive to the city.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
