OL,3,GNEWSASadness as one of city's last
OL,4,Adepartment stores to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Montano, professor of retail
OL,7,Fmarketing at the University of
OL,8,FBirmingham, said the loss of the store
OL,9,Fwould be a "huge blow", particularly
OL,10,Ffollowing the closure of John Lewis in
OL,11,F2020 and more recently House of Fraser
OL,12,Fin June.
